WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.733 --> 00:00:03.503
Shiv. Dentist is ready.

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:16.449
♪ (ORCHESTRAL MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:34.633
-So?
-SHIV ROY: So.

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:36.836
What are you,
best pals with him now?

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.571
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:39.773
Have you done a deal?

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:42.042
Come on, Shiv. Talk to me.

00:00:43.075 --> 00:00:44.310
(LOGAN CLEARS THROAT)

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:46.713
Sell?

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:49.248
(SIGHS) All right. Fine.

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:51.317
From my perspective,
truth be told, yeah.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:54.487
Selling would be great.
No more blowback with my career.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:55.955
I'll take my money.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.224
Five years' time,
I'd like to be free

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:00.093
of this company
and the Roy name.

00:01:00.826 --> 00:01:02.328
This company means a lot to me.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:06.499
Yeah, sure, Dad. So, fine.
Keep it. It's a toy shop.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.167
Keep running it

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:10.270
for sentimental reasons
until you nod out.

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:13.239
-That's it? No hope.
-SHIV: Mm-hmm.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.774
Well, if you wanted
to get into it...

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:19.446
Look, you'd have
to forget everything. IBM it.

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.915
I haven't really thought,
but what's obvious is,

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:24.684
shutter the businesses
that burn cash

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:25.952
or someone else does better.

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:29.088
We make video games consoles.
Hmm? Why?

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.090
(CHUCKLING) We make
indie fucking movies! Why?

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.092
Do we get a theme park ride
out of it?

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:35.094
No? We have an arm

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:38.064
that launches fucking telecoms
satellites that blow up.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:42.368
No. Restructure for the future.
Maybe merge with a distributor,

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:46.239
expand parks, expand cruises,
lose news.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:47.774
Paper and TV.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:48.908
News is trouble.

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:51.477
Ten new parks in China,
Russia, Middle East.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.812
You don't need the feedback
from fucking news.

00:01:54.012 --> 00:01:54.981
Right.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.149
But you haven't really
thought about it?

00:01:57.216 --> 00:01:58.785
Well, those are just
the obvious moves.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:02.589
Well obviously, I always wanted
one of you kids to take over.

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:04.524
Uh-huh.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.926
Well, what about it?

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:09.896
(SCOFFS) Yeah, we've done that.
What about Tom?

00:02:10.062 --> 00:02:11.264
(SIGHS)

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:13.833
So?

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:16.169
No?

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:19.706
If I keep going, if we fight...

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:23.009
I have to name Kendall.

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:25.478
Yeah. Yeah, I see what this is.

00:02:25.611 --> 00:02:27.780
I see it.
You know, I fucking see it.

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:29.915
You've done a little dirty deal.

00:02:30.015 --> 00:02:33.152
What, so, you keep Kendall on
to kill the bid and then he...

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:35.120
he takes over
when you step down in a year?

00:02:35.387 --> 00:02:38.591
What a squalid little fucking
backroom deal.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:41.360
-He blackmailed you, didn't he?
-LOGAN ROY: Oh, Shiv.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:44.496
No. No! I-- I--
If he takes over,

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:48.367
I'll sell my shares. Yeah,
I'll join Sandy and Stewy.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.103
I'll get Gil to go for you.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:53.706
I-- I-- I mean, I'll kill him.
I'll fucking kill him!

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.641
Shiv, why so angry?

00:02:56.108 --> 00:02:58.278
I-- I haven't done a deal
with Kendall.

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:01.113
-I do what I want.
-SHIV: Mm-hmm.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.416
And what I've decided
I'd like to do

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:07.120
is to formally ask you
to come in...

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.523
and be the next chief executive
of this company.

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:15.294
I don't think
I'm the right person.

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:18.231
Well, you know, I'm pretty smart
and I think you are.

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:20.500
You are, Shiv.

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:24.938
You're the one.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.512
SHIV: Are we actually
having this conversation?

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:34.847
Yes, we are actually having
this conversation.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:38.183
And selling? Yeah? That's--
What is that? Is that real?

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.252
Of course.
If you don't come in, yeah.

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:42.821
I mean, Roman? No.

00:03:43.388 --> 00:03:46.992
Connor? Ha!
I might as well sell, right?

00:03:47.192 --> 00:03:48.260
SHIV: (SNICKERS) Dad!

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:49.929
You know,
I didn't build all this up

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:52.064
to have some fucking
rockstar CEO

00:03:52.164 --> 00:03:53.633
waltz in and take over.

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.168
Dad, I don't think so.

00:03:56.535 --> 00:04:00.607
Really? Because if there's
really no hope of you coming in,

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.441
I'd rather cash out.

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:05.444
Look, if this is the way we're
having this conversation anyway,

00:04:05.544 --> 00:04:07.447
then yeah, fine, sell.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:10.283
Fine, I'll do it.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:12.252
Right now.

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:20.927
I'll tweet... the markets
will move, and that'll be that.

00:04:21.727 --> 00:04:22.461
Bullshit.

00:04:22.728 --> 00:04:25.832
-You don't care if I sell?
-(PHONE CLICK)

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.270
Don't be a fucking jerk, Dad.

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:33.439
You wanna do it?

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:40.580
Yes.

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:43.583
Yes.

